<h3>Advanced Securing Mechanisms</h3>
<p>Once vehicles are positioned within the <strong>vehicle transport truck</strong> bed, immobilization becomes the primary operational focus. Technicians deploy individual steel wheel-lock chocks against each tire to prevent micro-movements caused by road vibrations.</p>
